=20
> words.
>
> I=E2=80=99m not certain what kind of records, simulations, or experiments=
 you=20
> would be looking for. The CLL is largely unambiguous about its=20
> pronunciation, orthography, and grammar (though some changes are in the=
=20
> works). On the other hand, there is a growing corpus of lojban creations,=
=20
